                <div class="c-navscreen__bottom">
                        <div class="c-navscreen__about js-phatlines">
                Gregor Collienne is a photographer based in Belgium, specializing in people, fine art and commercial photography. Working with advertising agencies and direct clients across Europe - including brands like Audi, Volkswagen, Lufthansa, Deutsche Telekom, eBay, and IKEA - his portfolio spans authentic portraits, atmospheric landscapes, and advertising campaigns.            </div>
